{"unit_id":"zhuifengqug__dsh-adaptive-reasoning#card-zh","repo":"zhuifengqug/dsh-adaptive-reasoning","commit":"3d87a31a0162bf06a4ba05058432708bba116809","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-adaptive-reasoning（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：为模型选择器增加基于模型能力的推理档位调节。它在官方模型选择器的推理等级入口打开面板，并通过会话模型接口提交选项。主要功能有按当前模型公布的档位显示滑块、拖动时连续更新并在松开后吸附到最近档位，以及通过命令为缺少声明的模型补全推理档位。面板保留现有模型选择流程；可选启动补全从 models.dev 读取元数据。适合希望在 DSH Web 会话中快速调整模型推理强度的用户。启动补全默认关闭；无需 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:165-191","lib/client.js:519-618","lib/client.js:705-780"]}
{"unit_id":"zhuifengqug__dsh-adaptive-reasoning#card-en","repo":"zhuifengqug/dsh-adaptive-reasoning","commit":"3d87a31a0162bf06a4ba05058432708bba116809","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-adaptive-reasoning (DSH Web plugin): adds a reasoning slider to the model selector. It displays declared effort levels and saves choices through the session API, snapping to a level on release. A command fills missing declarations. Optional models.dev enrichment is off by default.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:165-191","lib/client.js:519-618","lib/client.js:705-780"]}
