{"unit_id":"zhuifengqug__dsh-adaptive-reasoning#feature-slider","repo":"zhuifengqug/dsh-adaptive-reasoning","commit":"3d87a31a0162bf06a4ba05058432708bba116809","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-adaptive-reasoning 的功能「推理档位滑块」：依据当前模型公布的推理档位显示调节面板。拖动时连续提交最近档位，松开、失焦或键盘操作结束时吸附并确认写入。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:542-618"]}
