{"unit_id":"zhuifengqug__dsh-adaptive-reasoning#feature-catalog","repo":"zhuifengqug/dsh-adaptive-reasoning","commit":"3d87a31a0162bf06a4ba05058432708bba116809","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-adaptive-reasoning 的功能「可选目录补全」：启用配置后，Host 从 models.dev 读取模型推理元数据并缓存，再补充缺失的档位声明；该启动行为默认关闭。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:71-91","index.js:190-217"]}
{"unit_id":"zhuifengqug__dsh-adaptive-reasoning#caveat-optional-catalog","repo":"zhuifengqug/dsh-adaptive-reasoning","commit":"3d87a31a0162bf06a4ba05058432708bba116809","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-adaptive-reasoning 使用前须知：启用启动补全或执行补全命令时会访问 models.dev；启动补全默认关闭，缓存写入系统临时目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:10-12","index.js:71-91","index.js:190-192"]}
